response_code_objects.description:
An object containing response codes that SoFi Tech Solutions has calculated, with a textual explanation of the response code. Consult  <a href="page:response-code-object-messages" target="_blank">Response Code Object Messages</a> for possible values.
Example:
```json
{
  "75": [
    "PIN retry count limit reached"
  ],
  "57": [
    "Card is frozen",
    "Load transactions not allowed"
  ]
}
```
